description.narrative:
Based on lessons learned during GCF-1, the Danish priorities for the period of 2024-2027 are the following:
i)	Enhanced access to GCF resources (including accreditation); 
ii)	Enhanced country ownership and efficiency of GCF support at country level; 
iii)	Private Sector: Promoting innovation and catalysing green financing, and 
iv)	Gender equality and social inclusion.

The Danish contribution to GCF is monitored on the basis of GCF's own annual performance reporting. The latest report can be found at the following link: https://www.greenclimate.fund/annual-results-report-2021
